work of the two versions lands, with a counter in an instrumented analyzer
built on the analyzer seam of @code{sec_4_1}. Count the @code{analyze}
invocations of one expression under each version, then count how many times
each version's sequence execution procedure runs while a one-expression body
executes twice. The analysis counts agree; the execution counts show Alyssa's
wrapper running where the text's version has no wrapper at all.
@end quotation

